      "executionScope": "Glob matching, schema validation, and serialization may execute during bundling, but consume only SDK-owned fixed patterns, configuration, and generated values.",
      "mitigation": "The build admits no request-controlled patterns, URI authorities, object prototypes, or array-like values and runs with bounded disposable resources."
    },
    {
      "id": "markdown-and-lint-commands-not-invoked",
