        "GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq"
      ],
      "executionScope": "The affected webpack-dev-server and SockJS paths are not started; @wordpress/components is externalized to the installed WordPress provider rather than bundled from node_modules.",
      "mitigation": "Evidence builds use --no-watch, expose no tooling port, and ship neither the development server nor its uuid dependency."
    },
